            "review_title": "Review at Totem Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Phoebe T\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nSpeak-easy bar kinda vibe. A place to really sit down, chill and talk. Great seasonal drinks.\nJan 2023 • Friends\nI’ve been to Totem about 3-4 times. Really hooked by the vibe it gives. Staff are friendly and do remember your name. If you’re not sure about what to try, ask the bartenders, they can give pretty darn good suggestion based on your favorite spirit and the permanent taste you like. A place that I prefer to go with besties or a date.\nWritten January 13, 2023",
